Author: Keith Ballinger <keithballinger@google.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 3 03:55:41 2025 -0700

    fix(hud): show tool executions in auto (YOLO) mode
    
    - In auto mode, tool.approval events are not sent, only tool.start/end
    - Modified tool.start handler to create new tool execution when none exists
    - This ensures tools are displayed in both approval and auto modes
    - Tools now properly show up with executing state in auto mode
]
